 {1:'This confuses simulation software with scene data and treats the unsupported count as an intrinsic size of the simulator.',2:'The official project describes 3D simulation; embodied navigation is consistent with simulated environments.',3:'The official project distinguishes Habitat-Sim simulation from supported scene datasets. The table’s navigation and question-answering relevance can be retained while its size entry remains an unvalidated source claim.',4:'A simulator is not a fixed navigation-policy model, and no evidence ties a model’s weights to the printed scan count.'},
