 {1:'The indexed official historical distribution table dates Ardent 2017-12-08, Bouncy 2018-07-02 and Crystal 2018-12-14. This corrects the 2017/Crystal pairing without endorsing an unsupported first-stable label.',2:'Latest is date-dependent. A 2024 slide label does not determine a current release or deployment choice at an arbitrary later date.',3:'This faithfully reports the order and labels printed in the source without certifying all of its other chronology as universal fact.',4:'The supplied order is Ardent, then Bouncy, then Crystal; Crystal is dated 2018, not 2017. This evidence does not independently adjudicate the phrase first stable.'},
