 {1:'This repeats the flagged slide simplification as an exhaustive ROS 2 transport inventory and omits the three service interactions and status topic.',2:'The cited design distinguishes the three logical goal/result/feedback sections from three services and two topics. send_goal, cancel_goal and get_result are services; feedback and status are topics.',3:'The service endpoint names are not the three .action definition sections. The middleware inventory is not five topics.',4:'Cancellation belongs to a service interaction in the cited design, so this reverses the service/topic count and misclassifies cancel.'},
